{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >s&amp;box is a game creation platform built on the Source 2 engine and our spiritual successor to Garry's Mod.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play, create, and share games, explore community creations, and experience endless sandbox fun with powerful modern tools.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY GAMES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >s&amp;box is full of games created by the community of every genre. Party up and play with your friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE GAMES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone can create games using our intuitive modern editor, creating scenes with a standard scene system and a C# API with powerful hotloading.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY FUND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can publish your games directly to the platform where everyone can play it at the click of a button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can earn through our <strong>Play Fund</strong>\u00a0from players playing your games, directly funded from cosmetic purchases.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPORT GAMES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or if you want, you can publish your games to Steam, royalty-free. (<i>although we're not quite ready on this yet</i>)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/590830?t=1774861397","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/590830/5adeda27734e8d02de5f0001a0e1abaabd88a111/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774861397","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/590830/7cc1dedaa1eb9a36b9a7eb204a79800ae1a328fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774861397","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/590830/7cc1dedaa1eb9a36b9a7eb204a79800ae1a328fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774861397","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP",